prompt_template:
Create a finished experimental editorial poster in {ASPECT_RATIO}.
{STYLE_FIDELITY_ANCHORS}
Subject: {SUBJECT}. Visible action or state: {ACTION}.
Render the exact main headline {MAIN_TEXT} once in oversized uppercase condensed grotesk lettering. Render the exact small supporting line {SECONDARY_TEXT} once. These are the only words in the image; preserve spelling and do not add punctuation or filler copy.
Case design direction: {DESIGN_DIRECTION}
Develop a fresh composition from the case concept. Use selected vertical shutter-like image bands as an intentional graphic structure, not a uniform filter, and let their rhythm interact with the headline and signal-red accent. Preserve a recognizable subject, sharp type edges, strong near-black/cool-off-white contrast, clean hard-edged fields, and useful negative space. Recompose specifically for the requested ratio. Exclude: {SOURCE_CONTENT_TO_AVOID}.
